---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section class="section-x border-t border-line py-16 md:py-24">
    <SectionHeading index="01" title="Integration tests" ruled={false} />
    <div data-detail-reveal class="max-w-3xl lg:ml-22">
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-fg/85 md:text-lg">
            The integration suite runs the application’s Flyway migrations against temporary PostgreSQL databases. Each
            test is isolated.
        </p>
        <a
            class="link-line pressable touch-target mt-4 inline-block font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.14em] whitespace-nowrap text-fg uppercase"
            href="https://github.com/Aquitano/aqt-health/blob/6e4f4ea48a3b7616042a1f8e16c80abc2b5838e7/README.md#tests"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
            Test setup <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            <span class="sr-only">(opens in new tab)</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</section>
